  "sourceTitle": "Champagne Rita Cocktail",
  "sourceText": "Champagne Rita Cocktail\nBy: Sheri Wetherell\nPublished: Tuesday, July 12, 2011 - 5:14pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 1/2 ounces Tequila\n1 1/2 ounces limeade\n1 1/2 teaspoons triple sec\n3 ounces Champagne\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Pour tequila and triple sec into a cocktail shaker half-filled with ice cubes. Shake well and strain into a champagne flute. 2 Add limeade and champagne, stir briefly, and serve.",
